==Terminology==

{| class="wikitable"
! Term !! Definition
|-
| <code>b_scan</code>, <code>B_scan</code> || Scan key pair; detection only. MAY be exported to an indexer process.
|-
| <code>b_spend</code>, <code>B_spend</code> || Spend key pair; signing authority. MUST stay with the signer.
|-
